---
name: convo-review
description: Review a finished Claude Code session with sessionscope (summary plus prompt feedback). Not available yet: arrives in sessionscope milestone 3.
disable-model-invocation: true
---

This is a placeholder for sessionscope milestone 3 (see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md in the sessionscope repository).

When implemented it will be a thin wrapper: it runs `sessionscope review <session-id>` out of process and shows the
resulting summary. The session digest is never loaded into this conversation.

Until then, tell the user that session review is not implemented yet and that `sessionscope report --session <id>`
shows usage and cost for any recorded session.
